Runtime: Eclipse Temurin, from the OpenJDK
Version: 21.0.13+9
Licence: GPL-2.0-only WITH Classpath-exception-2.0
Base image: eclipse-temurin:21-jdk

The runtime is a derived work: the modules of the official image named above that a JVM program such
as the basemap's builder uses, compressed, with debug symbols, man pages and header files left out,
made by the jlink line below. Its code is unchanged.

Offer of corresponding source
-----------------------------

The corresponding source of the runtime is Temurin's published source at the tag below, with the
jlink line that follows it.

Source tag: jdk-21.0.13+9

The runtime was derived by this jlink line of the image's Dockerfile (services/api/Dockerfile), run
in the Java stage:

jlink --add-modules java.base,java.compiler,java.desktop,java.instrument,java.logging,java.management,java.naming,java.net.http,java.prefs,java.scripting,java.security.jgss,java.sql,java.xml,jdk.crypto.ec,jdk.jfr,jdk.management,jdk.unsupported,jdk.zipfs --strip-debug --no-man-pages --no-header-files --compress=zip-6 --output /opt/jre

(/opt/jre was then copied whole to /opt/java.)

